# CODEOWNERS — default reviewers for pull requests.
# Create a "maintainers" team in the croa-project organization and add the
# founding maintainers to it, then this rule requests their review on every PR.
# (Until the team exists, replace @croa-project/maintainers with individual
#  @usernames, e.g. "* @yasmine-handle @darrin-handle".)

*                     @croa-project/maintainers

# Normative surfaces get maintainer review explicitly (belt and suspenders):
/spec/                @croa-project/maintainers
/rfcs/                @croa-project/maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.md        @croa-project/maintainers
/.github/             @croa-project/maintainers
